{"items":[{"id":"1468954990869495808","title":"问了问干留学的朋友","content":"<p>问了问干留学的朋友。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;现在留学不行了，大家都是在咨询移民。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;都想run....</p>","excerpt":"问了问干留学的朋友","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":40,"created":1643006161,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1468954990869495808"},{"id":"1467139295543209984","title":"今天请了个保洁来帮忙打扫下卫生，平台下…","content":"<p>今天请了个保洁来帮忙打扫下卫生，平台下单2小时是101块，打扫的时候阿姨说到手一个小时是20块，我当时楞了一下，还专门确认了一下。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;阿姨也很无奈。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;说平台要抽，公司要抽，到手就是这么多。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;当时我想着既然公司都抽了，是不是有什么基本工资还有保障什么的，阿姨说这些都没有，就是干多少得多少。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;听到这儿我有些懵，我问阿姨这种工资能生活吗？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;坐标郑州，低风险区，阿姨说这段时间就是很困难啊，大家都待在家里自己都收拾了，没多少活的，平时活多的时候算上平台、私活不休息一个月这些差不多赚上三千块。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;听完后有点难受，跟阿姨互加了微信，想着以后直接从微信找她好了。</p>","excerpt":"今天请了个保洁来帮忙打扫下卫生，平台下…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":17,"created":1642573266,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1467139295543209984"},{"id":"1466744114679431168","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-3f8ae22d122614a97b7a4472b37ae280_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"700\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":11,"created":1642479047,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1466744114679431168"},{"id":"1466361537221300224","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-4cb8738057ea7a2327c606d50c061dee_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"2337\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":24,"created":1642387834,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1466361537221300224"},{"id":"1466091493366206465","title":"搁这儿互相伤害起来了","content":"<p>搁这儿互相伤害起来了</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-93b7d6c5ae8c9605df946f7ced4b779f_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"921\" height=\"1151\">","excerpt":"搁这儿互相伤害起来了","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":3,"created":1642323450,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1466091493366206465"},{"id":"1465302503042117633","title":"岁月啊","content":"<p>岁月啊</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-809b26737e1af829aca14681c38379a3_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"604\">","excerpt":"岁月啊","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":26,"created":1642135340,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1465302503042117633"},{"id":"1464996369266511872","title":"一天天就爱网传","content":"<p>一天天就爱网传</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-4c3f7ca34385cf59974f438f5ad66d1d_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"519\" height=\"623\">","excerpt":"一天天就爱网传","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":12,"created":1642062352,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1464996369266511872"},{"id":"1463917987577597952","title":"什么叫“精准投放”？","content":"<p>什么叫“精准投放”？</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-284f7ab41ad079837a32b0da5694148e_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"943\" height=\"1040\">","excerpt":"什么叫“精准投放”？","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":21,"created":1641805246,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1463917987577597952"},{"id":"1463508836552634368","title":"这才是刑法的温度，可惜没多少人看","content":"<p>这才是刑法的温度，可惜没多少人看</p>","excerpt":"这才是刑法的温度，可惜没多少人看","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":16,"created":1641707697,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1463508836552634368"},{"id":"1462577125786624000","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-05f8d7c3dfd1c3e4df4a45f24381ff81_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"294\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":17,"created":1641485560,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1462577125786624000"}]}